group-ResultsComponent -> API_Results: "Get `resultSummary`, `displayResultNumbers`"
group-ResultsComponent -> State_LayoutConfig: "Get `componetId` of `miniResultLayout` by counter"
group-ResultsComponent.Loop_ResultContainer -> group-ResultsComponent.group-ResultContainer: Single Result Data
group-ResultsComponent.group-ResultContainer.ResultSummaryLoader -> GeneralSummaryResult: Dynamic loading by componentId
group-ResultsComponent.group-ResultContainer.ResultBallLoader -> TwoRowsBallResult: Dynamic loading by componentId
group-ResultsComponent.group-ResultContainer.ResultBallLoader -> OneRowBallResult: Dynamic loading by componentId
